!!! Case folding makes 'Tagged' and 'tagged' one name, so a value cannot be
!!! named after its own type in different case. Without a diagnostic here the
!!! reference silently resolves to the type and the failure surfaces much
!!! later as a method call with no receiver.
book bad.collision

Tagged begin class
    field tag as text
    public tag-of returns text begin paragraph
        give my tag
    end paragraph
end class

main returns number begin paragraph
    value tagged is build Tagged with tag being "x"
    say tagged.tag-of with nothing
    give 0
end paragraph
